This extension bundles Mozilla pdf.js (prebuilt distribution) for PDF rendering
and text extraction in the built-in PDF translation viewer.

  Product:  pdf.js (pdfjs-dist 6.5.438, build/pdf.min.mjs + build/pdf.worker.min.mjs,
            cmaps/, standard_fonts/)
  Source:   https://github.com/mozilla/pdf.js
  License:  Apache License 2.0 (see LICENSE in this directory)
  Copyright: Mozilla Foundation and pdf.js contributors

No modifications were made to the distributed files.

Design references (no code copied): OnlyTranslate (GPL-3.0), Translate It!
(Apache-2.0), FluentRead (GPL-3.0), PDFMathTranslate / BabelDOC (AGPL-3.0).
